Runtime schema resources and Public Suffix List
-----------------------------------------------
Jakarta Servlet API 5.0.0 standard XML schemas/DTDs are retained unchanged
under org/apache/amoro/shade/thrift/jakarta/servlet/resources/. These runtime resources are distributed
under EPL-2.0 (selected), with their original copyright and license headers.
See META-INF/licenses/LICENSE.EPL-2.0 for the full terms.
Project: https://jakarta.ee/specifications/servlet/5.0/
Corresponding source: https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/jakarta/servlet/jakarta.servlet-api/5.0.0/

Public Suffix List snapshots (MPL-2.0) are runtime data. The complete
unmodified source form is retained at org/publicsuffix/list/effective_tld_names.dat
and, where present, mozilla/public-suffix-list.txt, including original headers.
See META-INF/licenses/LICENSE.MPL-2.0. Project: https://publicsuffix.org/.
See META-INF/README-LICENSES for the selected licenses and source locations.

These third-party terms differ from Apache-2.0. Original XML/data source
forms are included for these unmodified runtime resources; API Java sources
are not bundled. Only package relocation/aggregation is performed.

TLS packaging change
---------------------
The five statically linked netty-tcnative-boringssl native libraries are
removed from the modified ZooKeeper dependency copy and the runtime/fat
JARs. Netty Java code and unrelated epoll libraries remain. ZooKeeper uses
its default JDK TLS provider. Configurations explicitly setting
zookeeper.ssl.sslProvider=OPENSSL
must select JDK. Original producer license records remain as provenance.
See META-INF/README-amoro-resource-changes in modified JARs.
